Subject: RE: RSVPs for Nov. 12 EEI Drafting Commitee Meeting

Body:
I've added RTO Product Transition to the attached Agenda.

-----Original Message-----
From: Perlman, David M
Sent: Friday, November 09, 2001 2:13 PM
To: 'Crespo, John'; Katz, Andrew; 'Cynthia Trueheart';
'fmdutton@aep.com'; 'elizabeth.sager@enron.com';
'harlan.murphy@enron.com'; 'martyjo.rogers@entergykoch.com';
'wfhenze@jonesday.com'; 'nicole.daggs@mirant.com'; Perlman, David M;
'ntrask@pwrteam.com'; 'drusso@reliantenergy.com';
'Shari_Stack@reliantenergy.com'; 'pdondanville@schiffhardin.com';
'babak.pooya@southernenergy.com'; 'ecomer@eei.org'
Cc: Delgado, Madde
Subject: RE: RSVPs for Nov. 12 EEI Drafting Commitee Meeting

I do not have a handout but I would like to discuss the issue of RTO related
product transition.

What do you all think?
-----Original Message-----
From: Crespo, John [mailto:jcrespo@hess.com]
Sent: Friday, November 09, 2001 11:41 AM
To: Crespo, John; 'Katz, Andrew'; 'Cynthia Trueheart';
'fmdutton@aep.com'; 'elizabeth.sager@enron.com';
'harlan.murphy@enron.com'; 'martyjo.rogers@entergykoch.com';
'wfhenze@jonesday.com'; 'nicole.daggs@mirant.com'; 'Perlman, David M';
'ntrask@pwrteam.com'; 'drusso@reliantenergy.com';
'Shari_Stack@reliantenergy.com'; 'pdondanville@schiffhardin.com';
'babak.pooya@southernenergy.com'; 'ecomer@eei.org'
Cc: Delgado, Madde
Subject: RE: RSVPs for Nov. 12 EEI Drafting Commitee Meeting

I am preparing handouts for the meeting, which will include an agenda, the
collateral annex, cover sheet and memo, the optional provisions, and the
committee organizational document.

If there are any other handouts for the meeting, please send them to me and
I will have them copied and inserted in the package. --JCC

-----Original Message-----
From: Crespo, John
Sent: Friday, November 09, 2001 11:23 AM
To: 'Katz, Andrew'; Crespo, John; 'Cynthia Trueheart'; fmdutton@aep.com;
elizabeth.sager@enron.com; harlan.murphy@enron.com;
martyjo.rogers@entergykoch.com; wfhenze@jonesday.com;
nicole.daggs@mirant.com; Perlman, David M; ntrask@pwrteam.com;
drusso@reliantenergy.com; Shari_Stack@reliantenergy.com;
pdondanville@schiffhardin.com; babak.pooya@southernenergy.com;
'ecomer@eei.org'
Cc: Delgado, Madde
Subject: RE: RSVPs for Nov. 12 EEI Drafting Commitee Meeting

If you are driving to the meeting, please park in the spaces in front of the
building and the building opposite our building (near the traffic circle on
the west side of our building) that are labeled as guest parking for 2800
Eisenhower Avenue. You will need to get a guest parking pass from the guard
at the front desk. If the guard is not there, please let me or the
receptionist know, and we will make sure the pass gets taken care of. --JCC

